<mj-text font-size="17px" font-weight="600" padding-bottom="8px">
  Confirm your email address
</mj-text>

<mj-text>
  Thanks for creating an account. Confirm this address to secure your account and receive order
  updates.
</mj-text>

<mj-button
  href="{{verificationUrl}}"
  background-color="#0b3d2e"
  color="#ffffff"
  border-radius="6px"
  padding="20px 0"
  font-size="15px"
>
  Confirm my email
</mj-button>

<mj-text color="#52606d" font-size="13px">
  This link expires in {{ expiresInHours }} hours. If the button does not work, paste this into your
  browser:
</mj-text>

<mj-text color="#52606d" font-size="12px">
  {{ verificationUrl }}
</mj-text>

<mj-text color="#7b8794" font-size="13px" padding-top="16px">
  If you did not create this account, you can ignore this message — nothing will happen until the
  address is confirmed.
</mj-text>
